I should have told you this months ago.

00:41:15.739 --> 00:41:17.739
But I was too scared.

00:41:17.739 --> 00:41:19.739
Clark, you know

00:41:19.739 --> 00:41:21.739
those caves better than anyone else.

00:41:21.739 --> 00:41:23.739
Do you know what this symbol means?

00:41:27.739 --> 00:41:29.739
No.

00:41:29.739 --> 00:41:31.739
I'm sorry.

00:41:45.739 --> 00:41:47.739
What can I do for you to leave me alone?

00:41:47.739 --> 00:41:57.739
What do you say to the ending for me to be

00:41:57.739 --> 00:41:59.739
a connecting part of yours?

00:41:59.739 --> 00:42:01.739
And if that's what you want...

00:42:01.739 --> 00:42:03.739
Then it gets better.

00:42:03.739 --> 00:42:05.739
Then we can be friends forever.

00:42:05.739 --> 00:42:07.739
And that's for good.

00:42:07.739 --> 00:42:09.739
I'm sorry, Clark.

00:42:09.739 --> 00:42:11.739
I can't forgive you enough.

00:42:11.739 --> 00:42:13.739
sí, de mi.

00:42:13.739 --> 00:42:15.500
Blur dentes y cortes.

00:42:15.500 --> 00:42:45.480
Thank you.

00:42:45.500 --> 00:43:15.480
Thank you.

